WEBVTT

00:06:28.409 --> 00:06:30.051
they're also distorted by poverty.

00:06:30.075 --> 00:06:32.726
We have a system of justice
in this country

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:36.676
that treats you much better
if you're rich and guilty

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.273
than if you're poor and innocent.

00:06:38.297 --> 00:06:41.900
Wealth, not culpability, shapes outcomes.

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:45.791
And yet, we seem to be very comfortable.

00:06:46.466 --> 00:06:49.397
The politics of fear and anger
have made us believe

00:06:49.421 --> 00:06:51.908
that these are problems
that are not our problems.

00:06:52.408 --> 00:06:54.055
We've been disconnected.

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:56.175
It's interesting to me.

00:06:56.199 --> 00:06:59.224
We're looking at some very interesting
developments in our work.

00:06:59.248 --> 00:07:01.364
My state of Alabama,
like a number of states,